sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as LMES Operator<br/>(trustyai-service-operator)
    participant Job as lm-evaluation-harness<br/>Job Pod
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelAPI as Model Inference API<br/>(OpenAI/vLLM/WatsonX/Anthropic)<br/>HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>(AWS/IBM COS)<br/>HTTPS
    participant Output as Output Path<br/>(PVC/Local Volume)

    Note over Operator,Job: Step 1: Job Creation
    Operator->>Job: Create K8s Job<br/>Inject env vars (API keys)<br/>Mount volumes (output, cache)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes RBAC

    Note over Job,HFHub: Step 2: Load Evaluation Tasks
    Job->>HFHub: GET benchmark datasets<br/>Port: 443/TCP<br/>Protocol: HTTPS, TLS<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN env var
    HFHub-->>Job: Dataset artifacts

    Note over Job,S3: Step 3: Download Additional Data (optional)
    Job->>S3: GET datasets/model artifacts<br/>Protocol: HTTPS, TLS<br/>Auth: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID +<br/>AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY env vars
    S3-->>Job: Data artifacts

    Note over Job,ModelAPI: Step 4: Run Inference Evaluations
    loop For each evaluation task/sample
        Job->>ModelAPI: POST inference request<br/>Protocol: HTTPS, TLS<br/>Auth: API key env var<br/>(OPENAI_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY /<br/>WATSONX_API_KEY)
        ModelAPI-->>Job: Inference response
    end

    Note over Job,Output: Step 5: Write Results
    Job->>Job: Score responses<br/>Compute metrics
    Job->>Output: Write evaluation results<br/>Protocol: Filesystem<br/>No encryption (local)

    Note over Operator,Job: Step 6: Job Completion
    Job-->>Operator: Job exits (success/failure)<br/>Kubernetes Job status
